#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Old Man Oi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "84_Old Man Oi"
msgid "You new in town?"
msgstr "¿Eres nuevo por aquí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "96_Homeless Hiyoshi"
msgid "Yep. Heard there was a big-time informant in these parts.\\r\nOne who hires fellas who're down on their luck."
msgstr "Síp. Escuché que hay un informante por aquí.\\r\nAlguien que contrata a los menos afortunados."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108_Old Man Oi"
msgid "Sure, we all know the rumors. But I've been in this city\\r\na year already and haven't seen head nor tail of 'im."
msgstr "Claro, todos conocemos el rumor. Pero he vivido aquí\\r\nun año y nunca le he visto ni el rastro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Homeless Hiyoshi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "120_Homeless Hiyoshi"
msgid "Go figure. I reckon he only hires folks he can trust."
msgstr "Quién sabe. Supongo que solo contrata a personas de confianza."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Old Man Oi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "132_Old Man Oi"
msgid "Well, that's a given. In the info biz, trust is everything."
msgstr "Obvio. En el negocio de la información, la confianza lo es todo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "144_Homeless Hiyoshi"
msgid "Sure. But if I could get one of those intel-running gigs,\\r\nI'd be living on easy street."
msgstr "Claro. Pero si pudiera entrar en eso de la información,\\r\nviviría a gusto en la calle."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "156_Old Man Oi"
msgid "Well, you'd at least be making enough money to eat.\\r\nBut why should he hire you? You don't have a single\\r\ncontact, let alone a network to gather info from."
msgstr "Bueno, ganarías lo suficiente para comer.\\r\nPero, ¿Por qué te contrataría? No tienes ningun\\r\ncontacto, y menos de donde sacar información."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Homeless Hiyoshi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "168_Homeless Hiyoshi"
msgid "Eh, you're probably right. Guess I should just forget it."
msgstr "Eh, es verdad. Mejor lo olvido."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=4
msgctxt "180_Saejima"
msgid "(So this information broker's real enough, but no one's got any solid info on the guy... Figures.)"
msgstr "(Así que este informante es real, pero no hay información sobre el tipo... Por supuesto)."
